  "description": "Liam Lucas returns home in glory as a revered war hero. Before departing for the battlefield, he had received a solemn promise from the Emperor: vast wealth, high honor, and the hand of the Imperial Princess in marriage. Armed with his triumphant return, Liam believes his miserable, downtrodden life as an Omega is finally over, and a glittering future lies ahead. \n\nHowever, an unexpected obstacle stands squarely in his path: Frederick, the Crown Prince of the Empire and his childhood friend, fiercely opposes the upcoming royal wedding. Unbeknownst to Liam, Frederick harbors his own dark, possessive desires for the war hero, determined to stop the marriage at all costs and keep the Omega strictly for himself. \n\n(Source: Lezhin US)",
